      "content": "hey, i keep getting this really weird pain in my chest. it feels like something is literally ripping inside me right near my collarbone and it goes down my back a bit. it started like an hour ago and it's kinda scary. it's not like a normal cramp, it's just this sharp tearing feeling. what do u think it is??",
